        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"id\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Hubungan perdagangan Uni Eropa - Indonesia</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {tex:{inlineMath:[['$','$'],['\\\\(','\\\\)']],displayMath:[['$$','$$'],['\\\\[','\\\\]']]}};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  body{margin:0;background:#073895;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#fff}\n  .page{width:1920px;min-height:1357px;margin:auto;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#073895}\n  h1{font-size:74px;font-weight:400;text-align:center;margin:38px 0 25px;letter-spacing:-2px}\n  .yellow{color:#ffdf19}\n  .top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:37% 21% 42%;align-items:start;padding:0 80px 0 72px}\n  .placeholder{color:#ffdf19;text-align:center;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px}\n  .handshake{height:455px;margin-top:15px;border-radius:45%;font-size:0}\n  .handshake:after{content:\"🤝\";font-size:295px;filter:saturate(1.6)}\n  .person{height:315px;margin-top:15px;font-size:0}\n  .person:after{content:\"👨‍💼\";font-size:270px}\n  .intro{padding-top:25px;color:#ffdf19}\n  .intro h2{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 8px -230px;width:220px}\n  .intro p{font-size:21px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 20px}\n  .mid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:37% 63%;padding:0 75px 0 72px;margin-top:-4px}\n  .leftcopy{text-align:center;color:#ffdf19;font-size:21px;line-height:20px;padding:0 35px}\n  .leftcopy p{margin:16px 0 36px}\n  .quote{background:#ffce16;color:#073895;border-radius:43px;padding:20px 40px 22px;font-size:26px;font-weight:bold;line-height:27px;margin:0 10px}\n  .exports{padding-left:20px}\n  .export-title{font-size:32px;margin:3px 0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center}\n  .bullet{width:29px;height:29px;border-radius:50%;background:white;display:inline-block;margin-right:34px;flex:none}\n  .icons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:26px;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .item{text-align:center;color:#ffdf19;font-size:21px}\n  .icon{height:158px;font-size:0;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}\n  .icon:after{font-size:117px;filter:saturate(1.7)}\n  .plant:after{content:\"🌿\"}\n  .textile:after{content:\"🧶\"}\n  .mineral:after{content:\"💎\"}\n  .palm:after{content:\"🫒\"}\n  .transport:after{content:\"✈️\"}\n  .pharma:after{content:\"💊\"}\n  .chem:after{content:\"⚗️\"}\n  .machine:after{content:\"🚜\"}\n  .timeline-zone{position:relative;margin-top:12px;height:330px;border-top:2px dashed #ffdf19}\n  .meeting{position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:0;width:490px;height:300px;font-size:0}\n  .meeting:after{content:\"👩‍💼 👨‍💼 👩‍💼\";font-size:125px;white-space:nowrap}\n  .timeline-title{position:absolute;right:42px;top:-55px;border:2px solid #ffdf19;border-radius:52px;padding:10px 37px 16px;color:#fff;font-size:53px;font-weight:bold;background:#073895}\n  .line{position:absolute;left:500px;right:35px;top:142px;border-top:3px solid #ffdf19}\n  .dates{position:absolute;left:510px;right:25px;top:55px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,1fr);column-gap:9px;color:#ffdf19;text-align:center;font-size:16px;line-height:18px}\n  .dates div{min-width:0}\n  .dates div:nth-child(even){padding-top:110px}\n  .nodes{position:absolute;left:548px;right:42px;top:128px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(20,1fr);gap:0}\n  .node{width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid #ffdf19;border-radius:50%;background:#073895;color:#ffdf19;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;margin:auto}\n  footer{height:40px;background:#ffcf15;color:#073895;text-align:right;padding:10px 280px 0 0;font-size:16px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <h1>Hubungan perdagangan Uni Eropa - Indonesia</h1>\n\n  <section class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder handshake\">[Ilustrasi: jabat tangan Indonesia dan Uni Eropa]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder person\">[Ilustrasi: pria menunjuk]</div>\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      <h2>Apa itu<br>IEU-CEPA?</h2>\n      <p>IEU-CEPA merupakan perjanjian kemitraan ekonomi<br>komprehensif antara Indonesia dan Uni Eropa yang<br>mencakup perdagangan barang dan jasa, investasi, hingga<br>ekonomi berkelanjutan.</p>\n      <p>Lewat kerja sama ini, produk-produk ekspor Indonesia akan<br>menikmati tarif nol di 90,4% pasar Uni Eropa,<br>termasuk komoditas unggulan seperti sawit, tekstil, alas<br>kaki, produk perikanan, dan bahan baku energi terbarukan.</p>\n      <p>Perjanjian ini juga membuka akses bagi investor asal Uni<br>Eropa untuk menanamkan modal di Indonesia sehingga<br>berpotensi menciptakan lapangan kerja baru.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"mid\">\n    <div class=\"leftcopy\">\n      <p><b>Indonesia</b> dan <b>Uni Eropa</b> pada Selasa (23/9) meneken<br>perjanjian kemitraan ekonomi komprehensif yang meliputi<br>perdagangan barang serta jasa, investasi, perlindungan<br>lingkungan, dan keberlanjutan.</p>\n      <p>Diinisiasi sejak 2016, kesepakatan ini baru mencapai<br>kesepakatan sembilan tahun kemudian, setelah melalui<br>setidaknya 17 pertemuan.</p>\n      <div class=\"quote\">Menteri Koordinator Bidang<br>Perekonomian Airlangga Hartarto<br>menyebut perjanjian itu berpotensi<br>meningkatkan ekonomi Indonesia hingga<br>USD 2,8 Miliar</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"exports\">\n      <div class=\"export-title\"><span class=\"bullet\"></span>Ekspor utama Indonesia ke Uni Eropa</div>\n      <div class=\"icons\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon plant\">[Perkebunan]</div>Perkebunan</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon textile\">[Tekstil]</div>Tekstil</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon mineral\">[Mineral]</div>Mineral</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon palm\">[Minyak Sawit]</div>Minyak Sawit</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"export-title\"><span class=\"bullet\"></span>Ekspor utama Uni Eropa ke Indonesia</div>\n      <div class=\"icons\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon transport\">[Alat Transportasi]</div>Alat Transportasi</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon pharma\">[Produk Farmasi]</div>Produk Farmasi</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon chem\">[Bahan Kimia]</div>Bahan Kimia</div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"icon machine\">[Mesin Industri]</div>Mesin Industri</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"timeline-zone\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder meeting\">[Ilustrasi: tiga orang menandatangani dokumen]</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-title\">Linimasa IEU-CEPA</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dates\">\n      <div>20-21 Sep<br>2016,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>24-27 Jan<br>2017,<br>Bali</div>\n      <div>11-15 Sep<br>2017,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>19-23 Feb<br>2018,<br>Solo</div>\n      <div>9-13 Jul<br>2018,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>15-19 Okt<br>2018,<br>Palembang</div>\n      <div>11-15 Mar<br>2019,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>17-21 Jun<br>2019,<br>Jakarta</div>\n      <div>2-6 Des<br>2021,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>22 Feb -<br>5 Mar<br>2021,<br>Virtual</div>\n      <div>8-12 Nov<br>2022,<br>Virtual</div>\n      <div>12-16 Des<br>2022,<br>Virtual</div>\n      <div>6-13 Feb<br>2023,<br>Bali</div>\n      <div>8-12 Mei<br>2023,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>10-14 Jul<br>2023,<br>Yogyakarta</div>\n      <div>4-8 Des<br>2023,<br>Virtual</div>\n      <div>26 Feb -<br>1 Mar 2024,<br>Bandung</div>\n      <div>13-17 Mei<br>2024,<br>Brussels</div>\n      <div>1-5 Jul<br>2025,<br>Bogor</div>\n      <div>23 Sep<br>2025,<br>Bali</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"nodes\">\n      <span class=\"node\">1</span><span class=\"node\">2</span><span class=\"node\">3</span><span class=\"node\">4</span><span class=\"node\">5</span>\n      <span class=\"node\">